cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository. The paper citation will be added upon publication."
title: "UCNX-PIV: inference release for teacher-guided trajectory consistency learning"
abstract: >-
  Inference code and trained weights for UnConvNeXt-PIV (UCNX-PIV), an
  unsupervised ConvNeXt-based particle image velocimetry model.  The release
  includes five sample image pairs for a quick code check.
type: software
